@ferfx Hey, If you ask which FTR is more important you should check what is to the left.

If FTR1 is created after engulfing of FTR to the left it is very important. FTR2 looks like it is created after engulfing the high to the left (which is inside a range) -in my opinion it is not very important. FTR3 is created after engulfing the recent high - it could be quite important - for example when looking for the FOs. Everything depends what is to the left:P

Please remember to mark what is engulfed when marking FTRs:)

